b3b7-c00e771e73fd/MM10392_260609_19850_1.jpg"},"abstract":"\"Twenty-five years ago, when I first looked over the edge... I thought I was the kind of fool that should live here.”","title":"The Alaska Man Saving His House From a Cliff","tags":[{"name":"A Changing Planet","id":"_none","type":"custom"}],"abTest":{"testId":"nat_geo_landing_page_tests-479","variantId":"variant_a_control-1956","type":"textHighlightTest","variant":"variant_a","abTest":"nat_geo_landing_page_tests-479*variant_a_control-1956"}},{"id":"9f8b5cc2-a4c8-453d-b0af-c3278f378193","cmsType":"RegularStandardPrismTile","isPremium":false,"isEntitled":false,"isUserAuthed":false,"pageType":"home","storyId":"drn:src:natgeo:unison::prod:d9d8bd38-4dbe-4885-880c-082adda4e1b1","cId":"9f8b5cc2-a4c8-453d-b0af-c3278f378193_d9d8bd38-4dbe-4885-880c-082adda4e1b1","description":"National Geographic photographers were stationed from Iceland to Spain to document one of the year’s most anticipated celestial events.","aspectRatio":"3x2","ctas":[{"url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/photography/article/total-solar-eclipse-europe-2026-photos","text":"natgeo.ctaText.read","icon":"article"}],"img":{"crps":[{"nm":"raw","aspRto":1.499267935578331,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3.jpg"},{"nm":"16x9","aspRto":1.7777777777777777,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3_16x9.jpg"},{"nm":"3x2","aspRto":1.5,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3_3x2.jpg"},{"nm":"square","aspRto":1,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3_square.jpg"},{"nm":"2x3","aspRto":0.6666666666666666,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3_2x3.jpg"},{"nm":"3x4","aspRto":0.75,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3_3x4.jpg"},{"nm":"4x3","aspRto":1.3333333333333333,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3_4x3.jpg"},{"nm":"2x1","aspRto":2,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3_2x1.jpg"}],"rt":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3.jpg","src":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/7b0feeb1-0cc1-4283-bbcc-6cd0f4a4797a/image3.jpg","dsc":"On a project with the city council of Tarragona in Catalonia I traveled to Spain to document my 15th solar eclipse. I set up multiple automated cameras to include iconic Roman, medical, and cultural icons of the city. On this moment the total eclipse ends with a spectacular diamond ring effect above the bell towers of Cathedral de Tarragona.","ttl":"image3"},"abstract":"National Geographic photographers were stationed from Iceland to Spain to document one of the year’s most anticipated celestial events.","title":"Stunning Images of the Solar Eclipse From Nat Geo Photographers","tags":[{"name":"2026 total solar eclipse","id":"_none","type":"custom"}],"abTest":{"testId":"nat_geo_landing_page_tests-479","variantId":"variant_a_control-1956","type":"textHighlightTest","variant":"variant_a","abTest":"nat_geo_landing_page_tests-479*variant_a_control-1956"}},{"id":"0e9fb22d-f141-4f02-a407-4681dd517867","cmsType":"RegularStandardPrismTile","isPremium":false,"isEntitled":false,"isUserAuthed":false,"pageType":"home","description":"Learn everything you might’ve forgotten from history class about the American Revolution, just in time for America’s birthday.","aspectRatio":"3x2","ctas":[{"url":"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/history/graphics/crash-course-american-revolution-hub","text":"natgeo.ctaText.explore","icon":"interactive"}],"img":{"crps":[{"nm":"raw","aspRto":1.490538573508006,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/990354d6-b07f-4a1f-a2ff-73907ef3ca54/38_GettyImages-1318746968.jpg"},{"nm":"16x9","aspRto":1.7777777777777777,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/990354d6-b07f-4a1f-a2ff-73907ef3ca54/38_GettyImages-1318746968_16x9.jpg"},{"nm":"3x2","aspRto":1.5,"url":"https://i.natgeofe.com/n/990354d6-b